  "differences": "Fixed Go release.go/payload.go defer file.Close without checking its result. These checked cleanup regressions strengthen that boundary under the authorized resource-safety requirement; do not claim fixed Go already tested close errors there. Existing Go source filesystem readers demonstrate errors.Join(readErr, closeErr).",
