      "control"
    ],
    "causes": "Each cause is the full ToolkitError or null. Multiple causes only; single error is byte-identical, including details. Identical sticky primary/control stops deduplicate. Nested primary details retain earlier joins.",
    "consumer": "Service must expand these leaves when classifying any/all control causes; preserving only outer command.cancelled or command.deadline is insufficient."
  },
  "faultLimits": "Failures are injected at explicit close/finish helper boundaries. One fixture uses a real read error from a valid write-only File. No real kernel close failure is executed. All Rust fixtures are NOT_RUN.",
